                <invention-title lang="de">KUMULATIVER FUNKVERBINDUNGSSTEUERUNGSMODUS FÜR NEW RADIO</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">MODE CUMULATIF DE COMMANDE DE LIAISON RADIO POUR NOUVELLE RADIO</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">RADIO LINK CONTROL CUMULATIVE MODE FOR NEW RADIO</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>There is provided a processor of a user equipment, UE, configured to perform operations comprising: identifying a first transmission control protocol, TCP, acknowledgement, ACK, at a TCP layer of the UE; storing the first TCP ACK in a buffer, wherein a timer is initiated in response to the storing; identifying a second TCP ACK from the TCP layer at a second time, wherein the second time occurs after a first time and prior to an expiration of the timer; discarding the first TCP ACK from the buffer based on when the second TCP ACK was identified; and encapsulating the second TCP ACK to form a radio link control, RLC, packet data unit, PDU, that is to be transmitted over the air.</p>
            </abstract>
